### Briefwise API: happy path, 404, 400 per context. Run the app (`local` profile) and use IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client.
### These cases are verified automatically by PortfolioControllerIT, MarketControllerIT, AdminJobControllerIT and
### PortfolioNewsControllerIT.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@corePortfolio = b0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002

################################################################ portfolio

### List portfolios (3 synthetic) - 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios
X-Correlation-ID: manual-001

### One portfolio with positions - 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/{{corePortfolio}}

### Holdings only - 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/{{corePortfolio}}/holdings

### Unknown portfolio - 404
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff

### Malformed id - 400
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/not-a-uuid

################################################################ market
### Prices are loaded by the ETL (later task); until then these return empty / 404 on a fresh database.

### Price history - 200 (empty list until prices exist)
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/AAPL/prices?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-15

### Daily move - 200 once two closes exist, otherwise 404
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/AAPL/daily-move

### Unknown instrument - 404
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/ZZZZ/daily-move

### Invalid ticker - 400
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/123/daily-move

### Missing 'to' - 400
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/AAPL/prices?from=2026-10-01

### 'from' after 'to' - 400
GET {{host}}/api/market/instruments/AAPL/prices?from=2026-10-15&to=2026-10-01

################################################################ jobs
### "Run now" (DESIGN 13.2, ADR 0016). Synchronous; 200 with the run status even if a step failed. Open until M4.
### news-ingest calls Finnhub and, through the consumer, the LLM (local: Ollama). news-classify is the sweep alone.

### Sweep of stuck RECEIVED items - 200
POST {{host}}/api/admin/jobs/news-classify/run
X-Correlation-ID: manual-job-001

### Ingest + publish + sweep + portfolio summaries - 200 (needs FINNHUB_API_KEY and Kafka)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/jobs/news-ingest/run

### Classification eval - 200 (ADR 0018). PAID: one Message Batch on Anthropic (~0.02 USD). Needs the decrypted
### golden set, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and spring.ai.model.chat=anthropic; otherwise the step reports REFUSED / FAILED
POST {{host}}/api/admin/jobs/news-classification-eval/run

### Unknown job - 404
POST {{host}}/api/admin/jobs/risk-alerts/run

### Malformed job id - 400
POST {{host}}/api/admin/jobs/News_Ingest/run

################################################################ news
### Per portfolio (ADR 0017). Reading never calls the LLM; the news-ingest job makes the summary.

### Relevant news: HIGH/MEDIUM, last 24 h, held affected tickers, by relevance then weight - 200
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/{{corePortfolio}}/news/relevant

### Latest daily summary (aiGenerated / fallback / empty, cited points, disclaimer) - 200, or 404 before the first run
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/{{corePortfolio}}/news/summary

### Unknown portfolio - 404
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff/news/relevant

### Malformed id - 400
GET {{host}}/api/portfolios/not-a-uuid/news/summary

################################################################ ops

### Health - 200
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
